      "explanation": "Substitute $x = 3y - 2$ into $2x + y = 10$: $2(3y - 2) + y = 10$. Expand: $6y - 4 + y = 10$. Simplify: $7y = 14$, so $y = 2$. Then $x = 3(2) - 2 = 4$."
